 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Crow and the Birdcage"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "Lately, 20-year-old Vivianne Sterling has been having a bit of a problem. A couple of years ago, she and her best friend were involved in a near-fatal accident that left both of them bedridden for weeks. Now, she finds that she can somehow see spirits, and they’re oddly drawn to her. But why now? Why all of a sudden? She’d like some answers and hopes that the new exorcist assigned to her from the Song Temple will be able to help."
  },
